    "title": "Response to Migrant Crisis: Hungary and Slovakia's Approach",
    "text": "• Hungary and Slovakia have implemented strict measures regarding migrants.\n• Both countries have faced challenges related to the influx of migrants.\n• Hungary has constructed border fences to deter illegal crossings.\n• Slovakia has focused on increasing border security and patrols.\n• Both nations have expressed concerns over the impact of migration on national security.\n• Hungary has been criticized by human rights organizations for its treatment of migrants.\n• Slovakia has also faced scrutiny for its policies towards asylum seekers.",
